UPDATE companies SET description='Second Sunrise Solar operates from Mt Pleasant, South Carolina, serving residential and commercial customers across the region. The company describes itself as family-run, a detail echoed in customer reviews, though no founding year or founder names are disclosed publicly. It began with a focus on guiding homeowners through the full solar adoption process, from initial consultation to long-term system monitoring.

The firm provides turnkey solar installation, handling design, permitting, financing, and grid interconnection in-house. Its service includes a Gold Star Certified Building Performance Institute (BPI) energy audit, followed by efficiency upgrades such as insulation, air and duct sealing, smart thermostats, radiant barriers, solar attic fans, LED lighting, and hybrid water heaters. All panels, racking, and inverters carry a 25-year parts and production warranty, while workmanship is covered for 10 years.

Customers include homeowners seeking to reduce utility bills and businesses facing rising commercial electricity rates. The company cites residential and commercial solar as its primary markets, with an emphasis on maximizing available tax credits and local incentives.

