UPDATE companies SET description='Seneca Foods Corporation is headquartered in Ripon, Wisconsin. Founded in 1949, the company began as a family-rooted enterprise and has grown into a publicly traded, vertically integrated food processor.

Seneca manages the full spectrum of production, from seed development and crop harvesting to manufacturing its own containers and processing a wide range of fruit and vegetable products. The company operates multiple plants across the United States and sources raw materials from more than 1,400 American farms. Its portfolio includes branded lines such as Green Giant Vegetables, Aunt Nellie’s, Libby’s Vegetables, CherryMan, Read Salads, Green Valley, and Seneca Snacks, covering items like peas, cherries, and cannellini beans.

Seneca differentiates itself through complete vertical integration—controlling seed, farming, processing, and packaging—and a food safety program built on seven major quality systems. The company cites its long-term grower relationships, employee loyalty, and capital investment in state-of-the-art facilities as foundations for consistent quality and shareholder value.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Seed production", "Crop harvesting", "Container manufacturing", "Fruit and vegetable processing", "Canning", "Packaging", "Food safety management", "Sustainability management"], "industries": ["Fruit and vegetable processing", "Food manufacturing", "Consumer packaged goods"], "materials": ["Fruits", "Vegetables", "Seeds", "Packaging materials"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Vertically integrated from seed to container", "Partnerships with 1,400+ American farms", "Manufactures own containers", "Seven major quality systems for food safety", "State-of-the-art facilities with ongoing technology investment"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1949 -> /about-us", "Headquarters Ripon, Wisconsin -> db", "Vertically integrated fruit and vegetable processing -> /about-us", "Produce seeds, harvest crops, manufacture own containers -> /about-us, /", "Partnerships with over 1,400 American farms -> /about-us", "Publicly traded company -> /about-us", "Brands: Green Giant Vegetables, Aunt Nellie''s, Libby''s Vegetables, CherryMan, Read Salads, Welcome to Green Valley, Seneca Snacks -> /", "Products: peas, cherries, cannellini beans -> /", "Food safety through seven major quality systems -> /", "Family pride, employee loyalty -> /about-us", "State-of-the-art facilities -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Seneca Foods is one of the most highly integrated fruit and vegetable processing companies in the US. We manage many\u2014and in some cases all\u2014aspects of pr