UPDATE companies SET description='Sensible Micro Corporation, based in Tampa, Florida, operates as an independent and authorized electronic component distributor and supply chain solutions partner. The company leverages a global supply chain network while delivering localized service to its customers.

The company provides a suite of supply chain services including component sourcing, inventory management and logistics, product lifecycle management, and testing and inspection. Its testing capabilities are backed by AS6081 and IDEA-QMS-9090B quality certifications and an ICE-3000 certified inspection team.

