UPDATE companies SET description='Skazma Custom Apparel operates from Longmont, Colorado, where it has served the northern Colorado region for over 22 years. The company is family-owned and locally operated, with family values at its core.

The shop provides custom screen printing, embroidery, and promotional products, supported by an in-house graphic design and production team. All work is done under one roof, allowing for faster turnaround times and quality control.

