UPDATE companies SET description='The company maintains a showroom gallery at 3824 AZ-87 and a woodyard at 4042 AZ-87, both in Pine, Arizona.

The shop builds live-edge tables, bars, bedroom sets, dining pieces, and office furniture, along with smaller items such as mirrors, burl-wood clocks, lazy Susans, and decorative saw art. All pieces are handcrafted on site, and the company accepts custom orders for residential and commercial projects.

The product line spans living-room, bedroom, dining-room, and office collections, sold directly through the gallery and via custom commission.

The company states that its lumber comes exclusively from salvaged dead-down, dead-standing, or nuisance trees harvested on private land or under National Forest permits, a sourcing method it highlights as a core differentiator. It also promotes five decades of rustic furniture manufacturing experience.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Handcrafted furniture manufacturing", "Live edge slab processing", "Custom furniture design and build", "Saw art carving", "Wood salvaging and milling", "Furniture finishing", "Retail showroom operations"], "industries": ["Residential furniture", "Commercial furniture", "Hospitality furniture"], "materials": ["Salvaged wood", "Reclaimed wood", "Dead-standing timber", "Nuisance trees"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Salvaged wood sourced from dead/downed trees and National Forest permits", "Handcrafted live-edge rustic furniture", "Custom furniture orders accepted", "Showroom gallery and woodyard on AZ-87 in Pine, AZ", "Five decades of rustic furniture manufacturing experience"], "facts_used": ["Located in Pine, Arizona -> /", "Manufactures handcrafted rustic furniture -> /", "Uses salvaged wood from dead/downed trees and National Forest permits -> /", "Operates showroom gallery and woodyard at two AZ-87 locations -> /", "Offers custom furniture orders -> /", "Company name Sky''s In Pine LLC -> /", "Claims 50 years of rustic furniture manufacturing -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Sky''s In Pine Manufactures the Highest Quality Rustic Furniture in the Southwest.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='skys-in-pine-live-edge-rustic-furniture-gallery' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Sloan Medical operates from Omaha, Nebraska, as a family-owned business founded by urologist Stewart Sloan. The company began over three decades ago when Sloan, drawing on firsthand experience in the operating room, set out to create protective gear that addressed the real challenges surgeons face during procedures.

The company manufactures two primary product lines. Sta-Dri includes impermeable knee-high coverings, aprons, bootleg leggings, and non-skid shoe covers that have passed ASTM F1671 viral penetration resistance testing. The ezGLIDE line consists of sterile, disposable single-use patient transfer sheets designed to replace reusable transfer boards and eliminate the cleaning products those boards require. All items are produced in North America using a one-size-fits-all approach that consolidates inventory to a single SKU per product, and most orders ship within 24 hours.

Sloan Medical serves hospitals, surgical centers, and veterinary facilities across the United States. Its PPE is used by surgeons, circulating nurses, OR technicians, and other frontline staff, while the ezGLIDE sheets support patient transfers in nursing facilities and postmortem care settings. The company also sells through a distributor network that includes American Medical Depot, Bowers Medical Supply, Healthmark Industries, and Medline Industries.

The business was built on the premise that PPE should be designed by clinicians who understand the operating room. That origin drives a focus on impermeability, comfort, non-skid safety, and durability—backed by ASTM testing and domestic production to avoid overseas supply disruptions. Personalized service remains a stated priority, with the company emphasizing direct access over layered sales structures.', certifications=ARRAY['ASTM F1671']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Surgical PPE manufacturing (gowns, drapes, coverings)", "Disposable patient transfer sheet manufacturing", "ASTM F1671 compliance testing", "North American production", "24-hour shipping on stocked items", "Free sample program", "EDI ordering capability", "Distributor network management"], "industries": ["Healthcare / Hospitals", "Surgical centers", "Veterinary medicine", "Nursing facilities / long-term care", "Postmortem care", "Medical distribution"], "materials": ["Impermeable plastic", "Skid-resistant tread material"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Most products ship within 24 hours", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Designed by surgeons for real surgical needs", "ASTM F1671 viral penetration resistance testing on all disposable PPE", "One-size-fits-all design reduces inventory to a single SKU per product", "Non-skid tread molded into plastic coverings to prevent falls", "North American manufacturing with most products shipping within 24 hours"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Omaha, Nebraska -> db", "Family-owned, founded by urologist Stewart Sloan -> /about", "Over 30 years in business -> /, /about", "Manufactures Sta-Dri PPE (impermeable coverings, aprons, leggings, shoe covers) -> /", "Manufactures ezGLIDE sterile disposable patient transfer sheets -> /", "ASTM F1671 viral penetration resistance testing -> /, /about", "One-size-fits-all single SKU approach -> /, /about", "North American manufacturing -> /, /about", "Most products ship within 24 hours -> /, /about", "Ser