UPDATE companies SET description='Solr Standard is based in Warminster, Pennsylvania. The company was founded with the goal of delivering high-quality solar solutions without the confusion, pressure, or shortcuts often associated with the industry. No founding year or founder names are publicly disclosed.

The firm provides solar system design, project planning, and coordination with qualified installation partners for residential and commercial projects. Its services cover rooftop solar panel installation, battery storage integration, and energy storage solutions. Solr Standard does not manufacture equipment but specifies premium panels, inverters, and battery systems for each project.

Solr Standard serves homeowners, property managers, and business owners throughout Pennsylvania and New Jersey.

